The SVGs in svg/ (and their copies in svgs.ts) come from vscode-icons.

Pack:    vscode-icons 12.19.0
Source:  https://github.com/vscode-icons/vscode-icons/tree/d2fc92ede72121115e17daf4db40afef6b2c22e4/icons
Commit:  d2fc92ede72121115e17daf4db40afef6b2c22e4 (master, 2026-09-25)
Fetched: vendor.mjs in this folder, which pins that commit.

Changes from the originals, all made by vendor.mjs:
- The <title> element is removed, so an inline icon shows no "file_type_..." tooltip.
- A fill that disappears on one theme takes the text colour (currentColor) instead:
  default_file (#c5c5c5), file_type_audio (#00007f), file_type_avif (the "AV"
  letters, unfilled black), file_type_markdown (#755838), file_type_text
  (the page outline, #c2c2c2). Brand colours are never changed.

